  - id: living_hope_1peter
    displayName: Living Hope and the Trial of Faith
    flavorText: Peter assures the scattered believers of an incorruptible inheritance
      kept in heaven, describing their present trials as a fire that refines faith
      more precious than gold.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Assures suffering, scattered believers of an incorruptible heavenly
      inheritance reserved for them, and explains that present trials test and refine
      genuine faith the way fire refines gold.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_1peter
    managerId: living_hope_1peter
