  - id: call_to_holiness_1peter
    displayName: 'Be Ye Holy: The New Birth'
    flavorText: Peter calls believers to be holy as God is holy, redeemed not with
      silver or gold but with the precious blood of Christ, and born again by the
      living word of God.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Calls believers to personal holiness matching God's own holiness, grounded
      in their redemption by Christ's precious blood and their new birth by the incorruptible
      word of God.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_1peter
    managerId: call_to_holiness_1peter
