  - id: royal_priesthood_1peter
    displayName: Living Stones, A Royal Priesthood
    flavorText: Peter names believers living stones built into a spiritual house,
      a chosen generation and royal priesthood called out of darkness into God's
      marvellous light.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Defines the corporate identity of believers as a spiritual house and
      royal priesthood built upon Christ the living/chief corner stone.
