  - id: civil_submission_1peter
    displayName: Submission to Every Ordinance of Man
    flavorText: Peter instructs believers to submit to every ordinance of man for
      the Lord's sake, honoring the king and silencing foolish men through their
      good conduct.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Instructs believers to submit to civil authority and honor the king
      for the Lord's sake, treating Christian liberty as service to God rather than
      a cover for wrongdoing.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_1peter
