  - id: household_order_1peter
    displayName: 'Household Order: Servants, Wives, and Husbands'
    flavorText: Peter directs servants to submit even to froward masters and wives
      and husbands to honor one another, citing Sara's obedience to Abraham as an
      example of a meek and quiet spirit.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'Gives household-specific instruction: servants submit to masters even
      when treated unjustly, and wives and husbands honor one another within marriage
      as fellow heirs of the grace of life.'
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_1peter
    managerId: household_order_1peter
