  - id: suffering_welldoing_1peter
    displayName: Suffering for Well-Doing
    flavorText: Peter urges believers to bless rather than revile when wronged, sanctifying
      Christ as Lord in their hearts and answering with meekness, since it is better
      to suffer for well-doing than for evil.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Calls believers to unity, compassion, and blessing rather than reviling
      when wronged, and to be ready with a meek answer for their hope.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_1peter
    managerId: suffering_welldoing_1peter
