  - id: stewards_grace_1peter
    displayName: Stewards of the Manifold Grace of God
    flavorText: Peter exhorts believers to arm themselves with Christ's mindset toward
      suffering, love fervently, and minister their gifts to one another as faithful
      stewards of God's manifold grace.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Exhorts believers to cease from sin, live for God's will rather than
      fleshly lusts, and use whatever gift each has received to minister to one another
      as faithful stewards of God's grace.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_1peter
