  - id: fiery_trial_1peter
    displayName: The Fiery Trial
    flavorText: Peter tells believers not to think it strange when a fiery trial
      comes upon them, but to rejoice as partakers of Christ's sufferings and commit
      their souls to their faithful Creator.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Reassures believers not to be surprised by intensifying suffering, but
      to rejoice as partakers of Christ's sufferings and commit their souls to God
      in well-doing.
    deliveredByManagerId: peter_1peter
